# Learning

After a feature or significant fix, append a concise entry to
`.cursor/skills/add-feature-pwa/learned/README.md`.

Use:

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — <title>
**What**: <change>
**Why**: <reason>
**Offline**: <cache/install impact>
**Gotchas**: <non-obvious detail>
```

Prefix deferred work with `[PENDING]`; never silently implement it later.
